BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (Small speech models have quietly become the most useful part of the local) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 684 Tm (stack. A forty million parameter network, quantised to eight bits, occupies) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 668 Tm (less space than a single photograph, yet it can render a paragraph of text as) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 652 Tm (natural speech in a fraction of the time a cloud service needs to accept the) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 636 Tm (request. This is not a marginal improvement. It changes what an application) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 620 Tm (can assume about latency, privacy, and cost, and it therefore changes which) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 604 Tm (applications are worth building at all.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 572 Tm (Consider the reading machine. Dr. Smith, who runs a clinic in a small town,) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 556 Tm (does not need a general purpose assistant. She needs a device that reads the) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 540 Tm (small print on a pill bottle out loud, in the patient's own language, without) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 524 Tm (sending a photograph of a prescription to a data centre somewhere else. The) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 508 Tm (constraint is not intelligence. The constraint is that the round trip must) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 492 Tm (finish before the patient loses patience, e.g. within about a second, and) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 476 Tm (that no image ever leaves the room.) Tj
ET
