1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (None of this is free of caveats. The licensing matters: the multilingual) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 684 Tm (weights carry a non commercial restriction, so a paid product must either) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 668 Tm (use the permissively licensed base model or negotiate a separate agreement.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 652 Tm (The language coverage is narrow. Five European languages are supported, and) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 636 Tm (a document in any other script will produce confident nonsense rather than) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 620 Tm (an error, which is the worst possible failure mode for a reading aid.) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 588 Tm (The voice catalog is fixed. There is no cloning, no emotion tag, no way to) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 572 Tm (make the narrator sound like a particular person. For an audiobook that is) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 556 Tm (a real limitation; for a notification system it is irrelevant. The lesson is) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 540 Tm (that a small model should be placed where its constraints do not matter, and) Tj
1 0 0 1 72 524 Tm (that is usually in the middle of a pipeline rather than at the end of one.) Tj
